<title>POLAND: CHEMISKOR JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.04 MLN.</title>
<headline>CHEMISKOR JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.04 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    0.04 vs   0.01 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	0.06 vs   0.04 loss</p>
<p> Operating loss	0.02 vs   0.07 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   0.62 vs   0.59</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    1.59 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	2.57 vs   0.32</p>
<p> Operating profit    1.66 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Sales		   8.85 vs   6.73</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish chemical company is Chemiskor</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
